    "name": "normalizer-pipeline",
    "comments": "PM record pipeline for the KubeScaleSense demonstration. Input files are split into records and each record is POSTed to normalizer-service. Three settings in this flow are load-bearing and are asserted by tests/e2e/assert-nifi-flow.sh: InvokeHTTP's concurrent task count (must exceed maxReplicas, A-13/FS-28), its retried relationships (D-02, the whole durability story), and its read timeout (must exceed the Normalizer's maximum processing time, FS-29).",
